     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-native-hawaiian-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-native-hawaiian-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-native-hawaiian-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2097-4</td><td>Chuukese</td></tr><tr><td>2088-3</td><td>Chamorro</td></tr><tr><td>2101-4</td><td>Fijian</td></tr><tr><td>2078-4</td><td>Polynesian</td></tr><tr><td>2093-3</td><td>Kosraean</td></tr><tr><td>2090-9</td><td>Marshallese</td></tr><tr><td>2079-2</td><td>Native Hawaiian</td></tr><tr><td>2091-7</td><td>Palauan</td></tr><tr><td>2102-2</td><td>Papua New Guinean</td></tr><tr><td>2094-1</td><td>Pohnpeian</td></tr><tr><td>2080-0</td><td>Samoan</td></tr><tr><td>2082-6</td><td>Tongan</td></tr><tr><td>2098-2</td><td>Yapese</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
